  "details": "Would love an option to disable the shutter sound from the camera in its entirety. In music venues, it's easy to detract from the listening experience of others when you're firing off hundreds if not thousands of photos in a night. \n\nThis becomes particularly egregious in venues wherein there's a no talking policy, nor audio muffling, so the camera sound reverberates quite intensely throughout the area.\n\nMany thanks!",
